OL,3,GNEWSATwo charged after police uncover
OL,4,A#1m cannabis farm
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo men have been charged after a
OL,7,Fcannabis farm, which police said was
OL,8,Fworth about #1m, was found in disused
OL,9,Ffarm buildings.
OL,11,FA search was carried out of the
OL,12,Fbuildings in Wall Under Heywood, near
OL,13,FChurch Stretton, on Sunday, with
OL,14,Fofficers seizing 1,788 plants from
OL,15,Fseven rooms, West Mercia Police said.
OL,17,FDonjet Nika and Illirjan Ramaj, both 35
OL,18,Fand of no fixed abode, appeared at
OL,19,FTelford Magistrates' Court on Tuesday,
OL,20,Fcharged with being concerned in the
OL,21,Fproduction of cannabis and producing a
OL,22,FClass B drug, namely cannabis.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
